{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.StandardModel.QuaternionSidedSymmetry","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.StandardModel.QuaternionSidedSymmetry","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:QOU.BringCone"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.QuaternionSidedSymmetry.leftMul_comm_chiralGammaU_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.QuaternionSidedSymmetry.leftMul_comm_chiralGammaU_iff","kind":"theorem","line":109,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/QuaternionSidedSymmetry.lean#L109-L121","doc":"**The left `SU(2)` moves the chirality label**: `L_a` commutes with\n`Γ_u = L_u ∘ M_i` iff `a` commutes with `u`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.QuaternionSidedSymmetry.star_reeb","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.QuaternionSidedSymmetry.star_reeb","kind":"theorem","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/QuaternionSidedSymmetry.lean#L105-L107","doc":"**Conjugation carries the right complex structure to a left one**. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.QuaternionSidedSymmetry.star_unitI","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.QuaternionSidedSymmetry.star_unitI","kind":"theorem","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/QuaternionSidedSymmetry.lean#L102-L103","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.QuaternionSidedSymmetry.star_bilateral","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.QuaternionSidedSymmetry.star_bilateral","kind":"theorem","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/QuaternionSidedSymmetry.lean#L97-L100","doc":"**Quaternion conjugation swaps the two sides.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.QuaternionSidedSymmetry.bilateral_complexLinear_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.QuaternionSidedSymmetry.bilateral_complexLinear_iff","kind":"theorem","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/QuaternionSidedSymmetry.lean#L80-L95","doc":"A two-sided map `x ↦ a x b` with unit left factor is complex-linear iff `b` commutes\nwith `i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.QuaternionSidedSymmetry.comm_unitI_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.QuaternionSidedSymmetry.comm_unitI_iff","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/QuaternionSidedSymmetry.lean#L68-L78","doc":"`b` commutes with `i` iff `b` is complex (`imJ = imK = 0`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.QuaternionSidedSymmetry.rightMul_complexLinear_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.QuaternionSidedSymmetry.rightMul_complexLinear_iff","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/QuaternionSidedSymmetry.lean#L60-L66","doc":"Right multiplication by `b` is complex-linear iff `b` commutes with `i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.QuaternionSidedSymmetry.leftMul_complexLinear","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.QuaternionSidedSymmetry.leftMul_complexLinear","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/QuaternionSidedSymmetry.lean#L55-L58","doc":"Left multiplication commutes with the right complex structure. ","signatureChunk":0}]}